# Vector art in the editor (Phase 14 M0): a Vector Shape from Add Node draws
# in the viewport, its preset and colours edit live, it saves, and it stays
# crisp when the viewport zooms in (re-tessellated for the zoom).
wait 5
key escape
click @hier.add
expect add-node-open == true
type vector
screenshot add_node_vector
click @addnode.create
expect add-node-open == false
expect selected == VectorShape
expect node:VectorShape.type == VectorShapeNode
expect node:VectorShape.prop.preset == Star
screenshot vector_star
click @insp.prop:preset
click @pick:Character
expect node:VectorShape.prop.preset == Character
dblclick @insp.prop:strokeWidth
key cmd+a
type 2
key enter
expect node:VectorShape.prop.strokeWidth == 2
screenshot vector_character
key f
wait 3
scroll @viewport 6
wait 3
screenshot vector_zoomed
key cmd+s
wait 2
expect file:scenes/main.scene.json contains VectorShapeNode
expect file:scenes/main.scene.json contains "preset": "Character"
